    "name_raw": "Mother's Gift",
    "definition_type_raw": "Changeling",
    "source_book_raw": null,
    "definition_raw": "You inherit a special boon from your hag parent.   Prerequisites: Changeling. Benefit: Your dark legacy manifests in one of the following ways. You choose the manifestation when you choose the feat, and once selected it cannot be changed.  Hag Claws (Ex): You gain a +1 bonus on attack and damage rolls with your claws. Surprisingly Tough (Ex): Your natural armor bonus increases by +1. Uncanny Resistance (Su): You gain spell resistance equal to 6 + your character level.  Special: You can gain this feat up to three times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, you must select a different manifestation.",
